    "summary": "For an **INFANTRY/MOUNTED THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model. Once per battle across your army, when the bearer is **destroyed**, roll one D6 as the phase ends. On a 2+, set the bearer up again on the battlefield:\n\n- **unengaged**, as near as it can be to the spot where it was destroyed\n- as a unit of its own, outside any **attached unit**, whose **starting strength** is 1\n- with 3 wounds remaining",
